PLACEHOLDER — not yet captured.

Per the repo's ansible convention, this file should hold Alpine's actual shipped
/etc/ssh/sshd_config, captured before the hardening template in
../templates/sshd_config.j2 is ever applied to a live box, so the two can be diffed.

One-time step (run once against a fresh instance, before the first `ansible-playbook
site.yml` run that includes the common role):

    ansible -m fetch -a "src=/etc/ssh/sshd_config dest=roles/common/files/sshd_config.orig flat=yes" temperingworks_web

Then replace this placeholder with the fetched file and commit it.
